OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,BFamiliar faces and surprise chances as 
OL,5,BIreland face Wallabies                 
OL,6,GDiscussion about how Ireland head      
OL,7,Gcoach Andy Farrell would approach      
OL,8,GFriday's Nations Championship fifth-   
OL,9,Gplace play-off against Australia was   
OL,10,Gended emphatically by the team         
OL,11,Gannouncement on Wednesday.             
OL,13,FWhile Farrell would have been excused  
OL,14,Ffor fielding a rotated side in the     
OL,15,Fwake of last week's bruising victory   
OL,16,Fover world champions South Africa, he  
OL,17,Finstead opted for continuity and is    
OL,18,Fchallenging his first-choice line-up   
OL,19,Fto produce another chest-thumping 80-  
OL,20,Fminute display against the Wallabies.  
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
