OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,BGreece will 'stretch us' in friendlies 
OL,5,B- McArdle                              
OL,6,GNorthern Ireland manager Michael       
OL,7,GMcArdle says Greece were "deliberately 
OL,8,Gpicked to stretch us" in two home      
OL,9,Gfriendlies, beginning with Friday's    
OL,10,Gfirst game at Inver Park.              
OL,12,FThe sides meet again in Larne on       
OL,13,FTuesday (16:00) as they begin          
OL,14,Fpreparations for their respective      
OL,15,FNations League B campaigns in 2027.    
OL,17,FBoth missed out on qualification for   
OL,18,Fnext year's World Cup in Brazil at the 
OL,19,Fplay-off stage, with Northern Ireland  
OL,20,Fbeaten by Portugal, while Greece were  
OL,21,Feliminated by England.                 
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
