OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,BTwickenham set to be half empty for    
OL,5,BNations Championship finals opening    
OL,6,Bnight                                  
OL,7,GThe start of the Nations Championship  
OL,8,Gfinals weekend will play out in front  
OL,9,Gof thousands of empty seats on Friday  
OL,10,Gwith Twickenham's Allianz Stadium set  
OL,11,Gto be filled to about half its 82,000- 
OL,12,Gseater capacity.                       
OL,14,FThe uppermost tier of the stadium is   
OL,15,Fentirely closed, while just over half  
OL,16,Fof the middle tier is open.            
OL,18,FTickets are on sale closer to the      
OL,19,Faction, with a large proportion of     
OL,20,Fseats in some lower-tier sections,     
OL,21,Fnotably in the north-west corner of    
OL,22,Fthe stadium, remaining.           G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
