OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,BBBC confirms Irish Premiership streams 
OL,5,Bfor 2027                               
OL,6,GBBC Sport NI has announced the latest  
OL,7,GIrish Premiership matches that will be 
OL,8,Glive on BBC iPlayer and the BBC Sport  
OL,9,Gapp and website in 2027.               
OL,11,FSeven additional matches will be       
OL,12,Favailable to watch live across BBC     
OL,13,FSport with additional live text        
OL,14,Fcommentary and in-game clips available 
OL,15,Fon the website.                        
OL,17,FThe BBC cameras will travel to the     
OL,18,FOval for Glentoran's match against     
OL,19,Fdefending champions Larne on Friday,   
OL,20,F15 January with the Glens' trip to     
OL,21,Fface Coleraine a week later also live. 
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
